- Branch pattern: `{{ branch_pattern }}`
- Commit pattern: `{{ commit_pattern }}`
- PR title pattern: `{{ pr_title_pattern }}`

Example: `feature/FIN-123-add-validation` / `[FIN-123] Add validation`

